    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "keypoint", "x": 80, "y": 460, "width": 1680, "height": 96,
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#ecfdf5", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160043, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160044, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "keypoint_t", "x": 104, "y": 478, "width": 1632, "height": 60,
      "text": "The counter resets on every successful switch\nA fresh provider gets its whole retry budget instead of inheriting the exhausted one. So the worst case is not\nMaxRetries attempts in total, it is MaxRetries attempts per link in the chain.",
      "originalText": "The counter resets on every successful switch\nA fresh provider gets its whole retry budget instead of inheriting the exhausted one. So the worst case is not\nMaxRetries attempts in total, it is MaxRetries attempts per link in the chain.",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160046, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "text", "id": "conv_h", "x": 80, "y": 590, "width": 900, "height": 20,
      "text": "What the new provider sees",
      "originalText": "What the new provider sees", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 160047,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160048, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "conv", "x": 80, "y": 622, "width": 1680, "height": 96,
      "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "#f5f3ff", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160050, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "conv_t", "x": 104, "y": 640, "width": 1632, "height": 60,
      "text": "The switch also rewinds the conversation: RestoreBookmark(_initialBookmark)\nThe failed provider's half-finished exchange is rolled back, so the next one starts from the same clean history\nthe first one saw. Without this, a fallback would inherit a transcript describing a failure it did not cause.",
      "originalText": "The switch also rewinds the conversation: RestoreBookmark(_initialBookmark)\nThe failed provider's half-finished exchange is rolled back, so the next one starts from the same clean history\nthe first one saw. Without this, a fallback would inherit a transcript describing a failure it did not cause.",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#5b21b6", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160052, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "text", "id": "which_h", "x": 80, "y": 752, "width": 900, "height": 20,
      "text": "Which chain applies, and to whom",
      "originalText": "Which chain applies, and to whom", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 160053,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160054, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "which_t", "x": 80, "y": 786, "width": 2180, "height": 95,
      "text": "role.Fallbacks present   that list is used, and the global FallbackProviders is ignored entirely  -  the two never merge\nrole.Fallbacks absent    the environment-level FallbackProviders list is used instead\nOnly LLM steps switch     StepBase.SwitchToNextFallback returns false; BaseLlmStep is what gives IFallbackable meaning\nA switch can still fail    if the next entry resolves to no Model, Provider or LlmService, the switch reports false",
      "originalText": "role.Fallbacks present   that list is used, and the global FallbackProviders is ignored entirely  -  the two never merge\nrole.Fallbacks absent    the environment-level FallbackProviders list is used instead\nOnly LLM steps switch     StepBase.SwitchToNextFallback returns false; BaseLlmStep is what gives IFallbackable meaning\nA switch can still fail    if the next entry resolves to no Model, Provider or LlmService, the switch reports false",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160055, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160056, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "trig", "x": 1880, "y": 362, "width": 380, "height": 356,
      "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160057, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160058, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "trig_t", "x": 1902, "y": 380, "width": 336, "height": 320,
      "text": "What triggers a switch\n\nAn exception thrown by\nthe step.\n\nAn error result carrying\nan OriginalException.\n\nA provider error, which\nBaseLlmStep deliberately\nreturns with its exception\nattached so it counts as\nfatal rather than as a\nparsing mistake.\n\nWhat does NOT: an error\nwith no exception. That is\na retry, not a switch.",
      "originalText": "What triggers a switch\n\nAn exception thrown by\nthe step.\n\nAn error result carrying\nan OriginalException.\n\nA provider error, which\nBaseLlmStep deliberately\nreturns with its exception\nattached so it counts as\nfatal rather than as a\nparsing mistake.\n\nWhat does NOT: an error\nwith no exception. That is\na retry, not a switch.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160059, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160060, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "text", "id": "foot", "x": 80, "y": 900, "width": 2180, "height": 19,
      "text": "Verified against BaseLlmStep.SwitchToNextFallback, StepBase.cs and RetryMiddleware.cs.",
      "originalText": "Verified against BaseLlmStep.SwitchToNextFallback, StepBase.cs and RetryMiddleware.cs.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
